  "details": "I and many other people when playing in VR have only one controller or only one hand. VRchat has a one-handed mode but it limits us to something very important and most of all in these updates. When I open the Action Menu on my hand it doesn't move at all, I searched in tutorials but I couldn't find anyone to explain it. And with the new updates that VRchat has as for example the personal mirror, I will never be able to use them.\nBasically it would be nice that people who have only one hand or one controller can use the quick action menu, which has settings that can only be activated from there. (I have HTC Vive)",
